# OpenGL ES 3.2 functions the guest calls (the D3D9 device and MojoShader).
# port/tools/gen_gl.py makes a host wrapper for each from the NDK's GLES3/gl32.h;
# `special` ones are written by hand in port/host/host_gl.c.

glGetString special
glGetStringi special
glShaderSource special

